   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zero Waste Gili: Transforming Island Trash</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gili Eco Trust is making significant impacts on Gili Trawangan, establishing the island&apos;s first recycling facility &amp; processing tons of recyclable waste to minimize landfill. By partnering with FMPL, we are solving the problem of inadequate waste management while creating employment opportunities for locals and working towards a zero-waste-to-landfill island. Your contribution will directly benefit the environment, the local community, and our collective mission of achieving a sustainable island</narrative>
  </description>
